		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Non habeo sane, reverende pater, quod <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>scribam, nisi scire velis, quid in comitiis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>actum.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Legatus <persName>Philippi</persName> causam in genere <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>proposuit; <foreign xml:lang="de">hat nüt sonders specificiert.</foreign></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Responsum est amice; nostri amicitiam <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>non abnuunt, modo iis articulis ineatur, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>quae religioni et libertati non adversentur.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Expectamus, quid futurum sit amplius.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Causa <persName>Pellizariorum</persName> nondum transacta est.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Denuo tres legati ad gubernatorem, ducem <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>de <placeName>Säss</placeName>, decreti, princeps legationis <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>d. <persName>de Rozins</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Bona spes est eos posse impe<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>trare, quod petunt, et in posterum nostris <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>cavere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Die münchen zuͦ <placeName>Morben</placeName> sind <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>des haffts, so inen der <placeName>Pellizarien</placeName> halb <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>angeleit, erlaßen, doch nit gar liberiert; <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>dan sy khein gewalt haben söllend, dis <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>guͦtt ze verenderen, ze kouffen oder ze verkouffen, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>on myner herren vorwüßen und willen; <foreign xml:lang="la">adde his,</foreign> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>das man die sol laßen ußsterben und kheine <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>meer inhin nämmen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Si non, ut volumus, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>certe ut possumus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Crederes tu pontificios <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>maxime mihi aliisque infensos, qui causam <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ursissemus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Minime: nunquam fuerunt blandiores; <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>contenti sunt, modo suos monachos retinuerint.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Concioni plaerique interfuerunt, et ipse de <persName>Rozins</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>multa satis humaniter mecum contulit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Sic nunc res a<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>pud nostros sunt.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">- Concilii decreta illis non placent, quod <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>nihil de rigore remiserint patres, quod manifestos <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>abusus non sustulerint; imo ne pfaffis ipsis canon<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>cicis placent.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">9. sessionem nondum nactus sum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Tu nos edoce de <persName>Grundtbachio</persName> et rebus <placeName ref="l832">Gallicis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>et de eo, an futurae nundinae <placeName ref="l157">Francoforti</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, revere<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>nde pater, cum tuis omnibus felicissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName>, 8. februarii, anno 1564.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">T[uus] <persName ref="p8009">F[abricius</persName>].</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Amplissimo viro d. <lb xml:id="p2z10"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, domino suo et in Christo patri reverendo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>